About

Statusline (heirline.nvim) help. This file documents the sections of the
heirline cookbook that are NOT yet implemented in this vimrc, together
with a TODO list. The implemented sections live in rvpm heirline hooks and
lua/hooks/heirline_components/*.lua and
are NOT repeated here.

Contents: >
